{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f69befdd52595d963eb2ec3965afa8446c9ac0cd25ae340ea6d2f08cf29cfdd1", "ja": "（『Charlotte・Charlotte』のふたりは\n公演を前に忙しい。今日は、メディア取材だ）", "zh": "（《Charlotte・Charlotte》的两个人在公演前忙得不可开交。今天要接受媒体采访。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "5dd5a6fe75d8a5bdc26714021d2a3185fa4eabef32923642ecd760fa832d3541", "ja": "お疲れさまです、仕掛け人さま。\n今日はたしか、情報伝達媒体の取材でしたね！", "zh": "辛苦了，制作人大人。今天记得是接受媒体采访，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1ebb4b6acbb739667f0d51eaed93c9e634b36b8db3b96071a9260501c4f219bb", "ja": "ああ。まつりは他の仕事があるから、\nエミリーひとりだけど……大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊。因为小祭还有其他工作，所以只有你一个人，艾米莉……没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "7f6c8ccf41c8038a8839c7883066ef91786611b87ddaf10e8a0751cc63ebc290", "ja": "正直、不安もありますが……\nでも会見の会場には、姿見もありましたし。", "zh": "说实话，我也有些不安……\n不过发布会现场也准备了落地镜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1004_p", "source_sha256": "efdc4ea15514accac5b1c318df1c7ef18f07dae9f54b03638fcc3551d4f5027f", "ja": "姿見？　……ああ、鏡か。\n確かに、ドラマをイメージした会場になってたな。", "zh": "穿衣镜？……啊，是镜子啊。\n确实，会场布置得很有电视剧的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "0081ceb0acdc78b54451de5b0f55400960620ff06eb009a3c927db3fa1c9b880", "ja": "はい！　まつりさんと私は、シャルロットと\nシャーロット。鏡の中の双子ですから。", "zh": "是的！我和舞莉小姐，一个是夏洛特，\n一个是莎洛特。因为我们是镜中的双胞胎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "f312c66292b7a25d2fdd6b2bb522314a520b2d933c2cf258caaa50f182813071", "ja": "私が鏡を見れば、そこにまつりさんがいる。\nそう思えば、心細くありません。", "zh": "每当我照镜子，就能看到祭里小姐在那里。\n这样想的话，就不会感到孤单了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c55570f44a973184df31a7ed19110e0776dcf41b730f30248919a4d0b2b1eea3", "ja": "それに、お話の中のシャルロットだって……\n最後はひとりで、がんばろうとしていました。", "zh": "而且，故事里的夏洛特也是……\n最后独自一人，努力着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "ee33a14cce240d4c656fec9267ffbcfa6a742de8cf14e2254471518e3b9466e9", "ja": "ならば私も、がんばらなくては！\n私は、シャーロットなのですから。", "zh": "既然如此，我也必须努力才行！\n因为我就是夏洛特。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9b108bb584484fceef7e95f52d0bcdbf9b2c709fbeb362213443f181bba60d23", "ja": "うん……そうだな。\nでも大丈夫。エミリーはひとりじゃないよ。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n不过没关系。艾米莉不是一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "3d55fd1661bdcc3da77a71162466d6b09ca893a83e04ab0929ec3d63d723e856", "ja": "ふふ、そうですね。\n私には、仕掛け人さまがいらっしゃいますものね。", "zh": "呵呵，确实如此。\n因为有制作人先生陪着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "57761f5ebc589b701afc46eb0b487dfbb7d090e44d36d9cb517afff32525328e", "ja": "とにかく、今日の会見は私におまかせください！\nまつりさんの分も、しっかり務めを果たしてみせます！", "zh": "总之，今天的记者会就交给我吧！\n我也会替茉莉小姐好好完成她那份职责！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a537c93e7ccdec116e3add76e9c913a4271854bfff78beac74fed1880f71c76f", "ja": "そうだな。じゃあこれも、\nせっかくだからエミリーに読んでもらおうかな。", "zh": "是啊。那这个也难得，就让艾米莉来读吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "4db405f7f06402d185de5c9ce8f8c36dcebfb6d9f1bb0b87cdbabd82a3377a0b", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、それは……お手紙ですか？", "zh": "制作人，那是……信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e3d34ed1eb07d3dce2e1e85a5a5e9cf474466d7ff26a53967e40cdbe97ac5425", "ja": "ああ。会見用に、\nまつりからメッセージを預かってきたんだ。", "zh": "啊。是我替茉莉带来的会见用留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "4fdc3ba80b3a0f517a7b35a1efde8552abc14bb288dcae18ea096c7fb79cb3d4", "ja": "まあ、まつりさんが言付けを……！\nけど、私が読んでしまっていいのでしょうか？", "zh": "原来是茉莉小姐托你带话……！\n不过，真的可以让我来读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8ea62ce1d2ffa536c4a7552b50710ca01d963c43187179a60c14a917b8cc9aa3", "ja": "もちろん。エミリーに読んでもらったほうが、\nまつりの気持ちが伝わると思うよ。", "zh": "当然可以。我觉得由艾米莉来读的话，\n更能把茉莉的心意传达出来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "2a324955968e8f8baef581bb2fe5ab8917f2c3e78a2f6381f91736ecab69a110", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……わかりました！　まつりさんの\n言付けは、私が責任を持って読ませていただきます！", "zh": "制作人……明白了！我会负责为您读出小祭托付的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fdaaa9d2f1dc212d14c1fc49bbbb55bbfdd1d49e0eb2e6ddfab5e27d7406492e", "ja": "よし。頼んだぞ、エミリー！", "zh": "好。拜托你了，艾米莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0303_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "e0c5a2fe29bdb34cb8d00456fcbfed6548affd7a767ae24f192ce0e6bd8ad9ab", "ja": "はい！　まつりさんのお心が伝えられるよう、\n精いっぱい、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "是！为了传达给大家松莉小姐的心意，我会竭尽全力加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
